            "review_title": "Review at Cẩm Thị Vietnamese Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Trang N\n1 contribution\n0\nA VERY BIG “?” ABOUT FOOD SAFETY AND HYGIENE AT CẨM THỊ\nJan 2026 • Family\nA VERY BIG “?” ABOUT FOOD SAFETY AND HYGIENE AT CẨM THỊ\n\nI spoke with the staff and requested to meet the manager, but the staff kept denying it, giving many excuses regarding the presence of RATS and refusing to resolve the issue, saying that “there is no manager and no shift leader.”\n\nI talked to the staff from the moment I was seated until payment, yet I did not receive a single apology. One staff member said that they do not have pest control. When I mentioned the food, the response was that it depends on each person’s taste, and that having RATS is due to the restaurant’s space…\nTERRIBLE FROM THE FOOD TO THE SERVICE.\nRead more\nWritten January 3, 2026",
