            "review_text": "はる\nJapan7 contributions\n0\nAn unforgettable experience ✨\nAug 2025 • Friends\nIt was my first time here, so I was a bit curious, but I was surprised by the rural scenery and food of Vietnam. I never thought I would experience delicious food in such a peaceful space in the heart of Ho Chi Minh City. I felt really good. 🥰\nWhen you visit Ho Chi Minh City in the future, please come here for delicious Vietnamese food! 😍\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten August 11, 2025",
