            "review_title": "Review at Cẩm Thị Vietnamese Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Donald G\nFlorida9 contributions\n0\nHidden gem in the heart of Saigon\nAug 2025 • Family\nI visited Cẩm Thị for lunch and was surprised to learn that the restaurant had just opened — we were among its very first guests. What struck me most was the atmosphere: it felt like stepping into a slice of Vietnamese culture, reminiscent of my visits to Huế and Hội An. Listening to the staff share the story behind the restaurant made the dishes I ordered even more enticing.\n\nBut the true star was the food — everything was simply perfect. I highly recommend bringing your family and friends here when you’re in Saigon. An unforgettable experience!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nFish dishes are must try!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 11, 2025",
